buffsw-cli stub: this file is replaced at install time.

If you are seeing this text instead of the CLI help, the postinstall
step did not run (for example `npm install --ignore-scripts`,
`npm link`, or an offline install).

Reinstall normally to fetch the real binary:
  npm install -g buffsw-cli

The correct binary for your platform is downloaded from the GitHub
release for this version and placed at this path.
